---
config:
  layout: elk
  flowchart:
    curve: stepBefore
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph users [User Access]
        direction LR
        Student([Student/User])
        Admin([Admin/Instructor])
    end

    subgraph auth [Authentication]
        direction LR
        P1[1.0 Authenticate user]
    end

    subgraph content [Content Management]
        direction TB
        P2[2.0 Manage tracks/courses/sessions]
        P3[3.0 Manage events]
        P4[4.0 Manage announcements]
    end

    subgraph enroll [Enrollment]
        direction LR
        P5[5.0 Enroll/RSVP]
    end

    subgraph feed [Dashboard Feed]
        direction LR
        P6[6.0 Build dashboard feed]
    end

    subgraph stores [Data Stores]
        direction TB
        DS1[(User store)]
        DS2[(Track/Course/Session store)]
        DS3[(Event store)]
        DS4[(Announcement store)]
    end

    Student -->|signup/login credentials| P1
    P1 -->|JWT token| Student
    P1 <-->|read/write user record| DS1

    Admin -->|create/update content| P2
    P2 <-->|read/write| DS2

    Admin -->|create/update event| P3
    P3 <-->|read/write| DS3

    Admin -->|create/update announcement| P4
    P4 <-->|read/write| DS4

    Student -->|enroll request, RSVP| P5
    P5 -->|update enrolledTracks| DS1
    P5 -->|update students/attendees| DS2
    P5 -->|update attendees| DS3

    P6 -->|pinned items + upcoming events| Student
    DS3 -->|upcoming events| P6
    DS4 -->|pinned announcements| P6